# Postgres (Supabase). From Supabase -> Connect -> ORM (Prisma), copy BOTH lines and put
# your database password in place of [YOUR-PASSWORD]. DATABASE_URL = transaction pooler
# (port 6543) for the app; DIRECT_URL = session pooler (port 5432) for migrations / db push.
# Both are IPv4, so the same values work locally and on Render. Same DB for dev and prod.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.[PROJECT-REF]:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@aws-1-[REGION].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true"
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://postgres.[PROJECT-REF]:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@aws-1-[REGION].pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres"
